    "title": "Dexter Finalizes B2B Trail Agreements - NewsBreak",
    "text": "11 hours ago Dexter City Council approved two agreements formalizing the city’s role in the long-planned Border-to-Border Trail connection between Dexter and Chelsea. The items, placed on the council’s Aug. 10 consent agenda, included a project agreement and a permanent non-motorized recreation trail easement with the Washtenaw County Parks and Recreation Commission. Read full article",
